; Clipnote 1 Save & Get Coding
CN1S:
Gui, 1:Submit
Gui, 1:Destroy
PrimaryUIState = 0
CN1JC = %JobClip%
CN1Clip = %Clipboard%
Return

CN1G:
Gui, 1:Submit
Gui, 1:Destroy
PrimaryUIState = 0
JobClip = %CN1JC%
Clipboard = %CN1Clip%
Return

